OL,3,GNEWSABelfast diva ready to take Drag
OL,4,ARace 'by the horns'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's time to start your engines. The
OL,7,Fnew series of Ru Paul's Drag Race UK is
OL,8,Fabout to start and contestant
OL,9,FCoral-Hole Mandi is ready to "take it
OL,10,Fby the horns" and "give it everything".
OL,12,FThe 27-year-old calls herself the
OL,13,FBikini Bottom Bimbo from Belfast and
OL,14,Fshe is the only contestant from
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland in this season.
OL,17,FShe is one of 12 contestants hoping to
OL,18,Fimpress Mama Ru and Michelle Visage.
OL,20,FHer plans for doing that?
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
